        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dianne Hiles\n- Organizations: Australian Greens\n- Places: Division of Sydney, Division of Dalley, Division of East Sydney, Division of West Sydney\n- Events: 1968 redistribution, 1969 election\n\nFacts:\n- The Division of Sydney was proclaimed at the redistribution of 21 November 1968.\n- The Division of Sydney replaced the old Division of Dalley, Division of East Sydney, and Division of West Sydney.\n- The Division of Sydney was first contested at the 1969 election.\n- Dianne Hiles is currently the Australian Greens candidate for the federal Division of Sydney.",
